The role carries a clearly defined mandate: the successful appointment will lead the recruitment of&nbsp;approximately 5-8&nbsp;senior engineering&nbsp;and product hires over the contract term, while simultaneously professionalising the&nbsp;recruitment&nbsp;systems, processes and capability that will underpin the company's hiring beyond it. &nbsp;

